An implementation of the Hangman game with a twist: the program cheats by minimizing word reveals to maximize difficulty.


# Cheating Hangman

This project is a Python implementation of the Hangman game with a twist — the program cheats as much as possible while providing correct information. The program dynamically updates the word choices to make the game more difficult for the player.

## How to Play
1. Choose a word length.
2. Guess letters one by one.
3. The program will try to reveal as few letters as possible.

## Setup

### Prerequisites
- Python 3.x


